/E (That I am willing and able to receive\054 maintain\054 and support the person named in item 3\054 and that I agree to furnish financial support during the entire 5 year period beginning on the date the named person acquires the status of an alien lawfully admitted for permanent residence and ending on the date on which the named person becomes 21 years of age\054 whichever period is longer\056 The financial support that I furnish must be sufficient to maintain my family\054 including the named person\054 in the United States\054 at a level equal to at least 125 percent of the current official poverty line \050as established by the Director of the Office of Management and Budget\054 under Section 6 73\0502\051 of the Omnibus Budget Reconciliation Act of 1981 and as revised by the Secretary of Health and Human and Services under section 6 52 of that Act\051 for a family the size of my family\054 including the named person\056    )
